  "prefLabel": "Puc 2605.02 Unencumbered Funds",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2605.02. Unencumbered Funds. If the commission finds that there is a significant amount of unencumbered dollars in the greenhouse gas emissions reduction fund that are not needed for program or administrative purposes, the commission shall order and provide for the rebate of such unencumbered dollars on a uniform per kWh basis to electric ratepayers.\n\nSource. #9352, INTERIM, eff 1-1-09; ss by #9615, eff 12-12-09, EXPIRED: 12-12-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2600.html"
